msgctxt "64"
msgid "I'll remember this! Next time I see ya, yer ass is goin' down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "You all right, Pops? What happened to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Don't touch me! You yakuza trash only know vulgarity\r\n"
"and violence!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Those hooligans even threatened my life! And you...\r\n"
"You're no better than any of them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Pops..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Wasn't that a little harsh? I don't know what's going on,\r\n"
"but something bad would've happened if Mikio didn't\r\n"
"show up to save you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I'll call the police if I'm in trouble. I don't need help\r\n"
"from the yakuza⑬and I certainly don't need help\r\n"
"from my son if that's what he considers himself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Mikio, I want you to go to Nagasaki at once. Understood?\r\n"
"You still have a chance to return to a normal life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I wonder what's gotten into my old man... I mean, when I\r\n"
"joined the family, he wasn't exactly thrilled, but he's\r\n"
"never been this outta whack before..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "If you want to find out, then ask. You're not a kid anymore, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Yeah... You're right, sir."
msgstr ""

